ind":"announcement","title":"C.A.G.E. is in Steam Next Fest","summary":"Steam Next Fest is here, and C.A.G.E. is taking part!C.A.G.E. is a first-person narrative adventure that begins as a dark workplace comedy and gradually bends into psychological horror. You work under an AI manager (fully voiced by a human), complete increasingly questionable tasks, explore a company full of environmental oddities, and decide how compliant you really want to be.The free demo takes approximately 45-60 minutes and includes:A fully narrated story with player choicesStrange tasks an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:17:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691699","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4641290-1841579228678923","game_id":"steam-4641290","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.31","summary":"While continuing to work on the full game, I'm also not forgetting about providing you, early players, with a good Demo experience! That's why occasionally I still update the demo with some additional fixes and interactions. Since Steam doesn't allow posting update notes specifically for a Demo, I did most of the updates (already over 10 of them) quietly, but since this one added a bunch of brand new voiced interactions, I decided to share the news via the main game page anyway.Update notes:- Ad","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T17:01:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228678923","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4641290-1840944183783777","game_id":"steam-4641290","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Achievements","summary":"Hi everyone,Thank you so much to everyone who has checked out the demo since it launched a few days ago! The response has been fantastic, and I really appreciate all the feedback and support.Apart from several bug fixes (thanks to the early players for spotting them!) and optimizing the Lobby performance a little, I just pushed a new update today that adds 12 Steam Achievements to the demo.I wanted to add a little something extra to reward players who are taking the time to thoroughly explore th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-16T11:43:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183783777","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4641290-1840310314354592","game_id":"steam-4641290","kind":"announcement","title":"The C.A.G.E. Demo is OUT NOW!","summary":"Hi everyone,I'm thrilled to announce that after months of solo development, the C.A.G.E. Demo is officially live and ready for you to play.You can now download the 45-minute preview (or perhaps a lot longer, if you wish to find everything it has to offer) and step into the unnerving hallways of Spire Corporation. You will be guided - and constantly judged - by an unhinged AI manager, fully voice-acted by the talented Daniel Quinton (DQVO), who I'd like to give a huge shoutout and thank again for","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T16:30:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314354592","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4641290-1839041357038882","game_id":"steam-4641290","kind":"announcement","title":"C.A.G.E. Demo – Release Date","summary":"Attention prospective employees.Management is pleased to announce that the preliminary onboarding simulation (designated as the C.A.G.E. Demo) is currently undergoing mandatory stress-testing. Early access credentials have been distributed to select media personnel and external auditors. Please remain calm if you observe unauthorized video broadcasts of our facility over the coming weeks....okay, dropping the AI manager voice for a second!Hi everyone. I'm incredibly excited to announce that the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T17:14:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357038882","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4641290":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:16:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:16:05Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4641290":"2026-10-26T13:16:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4641290":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:16:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:16:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:16:05Z"},"4879000":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:16:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:16:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:16:06Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4641290","app_id":4641290,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:45Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"a13b088696af3a1913d291724029ff8a96c54acf91f31296c072c919912287dc","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"C.A.G.E. is a satirical first-person narrative adventure where your choices influence the story. Guided by an entity with questionable morals, you must navigate through corporate gaslighting and environmental oddities to complet